{{ 'suntneew-a20-pdp.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

<section id="features" class="sn-a20-pdp" role="tabpanel" data-pdp-panel="features" aria-labelledby="a20-experience-heading-{{ section.id }}">
  <div class="sn-a20-pdp__shell sn-a20-pdp__section">
    <p class="sn-a20-pdp__eyebrow">Features</p>
    <h2 class="sn-a20-pdp__heading" id="a20-experience-heading-{{ section.id }}">Compact emergency power, built around the A20.</h2>
    <p class="sn-a20-pdp__lede">The orange 8,000mAh A20 combines 12V starting support, everyday device charging, a practical work light and guided clamp protection in one vehicle-ready kit.</p>

    <div class="sn-a20-pdp__stack">
      <article class="sn-a20-pdp__feature">
        <picture class="sn-a20-pdp__feature-media"><img src="{{ 'suntneew-a20-2026-pdp-01-overview.png' | asset_url }}" alt="SuntNeew A20 orange jump starter on a dark platform" width="1959" height="803" loading="lazy"></picture>
        <div class="sn-a20-pdp__copy"><div><p class="sn-a20-pdp__eyebrow">A20 overview</p><h3>Power that stays close to the vehicle.</h3><p>Designed for compatible 12V systems, A20 keeps emergency starting power and a PD 18W power-bank role together in a compact, carry-ready body.</p></div><div class="sn-a20-pdp__metrics"><div class="sn-a20-pdp__metric"><strong>8,000mAh</strong><span>29.6Wh rated energy</span></div><div class="sn-a20-pdp__metric"><strong>1500A peak</strong><span>750A starting current</span></div><div class="sn-a20-pdp__metric"><strong>PD 18W</strong><span>Fast-charging power bank</span></div><div class="sn-a20-pdp__metric"><strong>IP54</strong><span>ABS + PC + TPU body</span></div></div></div>
      </article>

      <article class="sn-a20-pdp__feature">
        <picture class="sn-a20-pdp__feature-media"><img src="{{ 'suntneew-a20-2026-pdp-02-starting.png' | asset_url }}" alt="SuntNeew A20 orange jump starter connected in an engine bay" width="1958" height="803" loading="lazy"></picture>
        <div class="sn-a20-pdp__copy"><div><p class="sn-a20-pdp__eyebrow">Emergency starting</p><h3>Ready for a no-start moment.</h3><p>Keep the A20 and its intelligent clamp close to the battery. Confirm the connection indication and follow the vehicle and product instructions before starting.</p></div><div class="sn-a20-pdp__metrics"><div class="sn-a20-pdp__metric"><strong>1500A peak</strong><span>Maximum surge output</span></div><div class="sn-a20-pdp__metric"><strong>750A start</strong><span>Starting current</span></div><div class="sn-a20-pdp__metric"><strong>6.5L Petrol</strong><span>Compatible engine capacity</span></div><div class="sn-a20-pdp__metric"><strong>5.0L Diesel</strong><span>Compatible engine capacity</span></div></div></div>
      </article>

      <article class="sn-a20-pdp__feature">
        <picture class="sn-a20-pdp__feature-media"><img src="{{ 'suntneew-a20-2026-pdp-03-capacity.png' | asset_url }}" alt="A20 8000mAh 29.6Wh capacity information" width="1959" height="803" loading="lazy"></picture>
        <div class="sn-a20-pdp__copy"><div><p class="sn-a20-pdp__eyebrow">Stored energy</p><h3>Capacity you can check before the road.</h3><p>The front display makes it easier to check available charge before you leave. For compatible vehicles, the A20 is rated for up to 20 starts per full charge.</p></div><div class="sn-a20-pdp__metrics"><div class="sn-a20-pdp__metric"><strong>8,000mAh</strong><span>Rated capacity</span></div><div class="sn-a20-pdp__metric"><strong>29.6Wh</strong><span>Rated energy</span></div><div class="sn-a20-pdp__metric"><strong>Up to 20</strong><span>Starts per full charge</span></div><div class="sn-a20-pdp__metric"><strong>412.3g</strong><span>Product weight</span></div></div></div>
      </article>

      <article class="sn-a20-pdp__feature">
        <picture class="sn-a20-pdp__feature-media"><img src="{{ 'suntneew-a20-2026-pdp-04-pd18w.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="A20 USB-C PD 18W charging ports" width="1464" height="600" loading="lazy"></picture>
        <div class="sn-a20-pdp__copy"><div><p class="sn-a20-pdp__eyebrow">PD 18W fast charging</p><h3>Roadside reserve for everyday devices.</h3><p>Amazon describes A20 as a PD 18W fast-charging power bank for phones and tablets. Its Type-C input supports charging the unit in 1.5–3 hours.</p></div><div class="sn-a20-pdp__metrics"><div class="sn-a20-pdp__metric"><strong>PD 18W</strong><span>Fast-charging power bank</span></div><div class="sn-a20-pdp__metric"><strong>1.5–3H</strong><span>Full-charge reference</span></div><div class="sn-a20-pdp__metric"><strong>USB-C</strong><span>5V/2A, 9V/2A input</span></div><div class="sn-a20-pdp__metric"><strong>USB-A ×2</strong><span>Device charging outputs</span></div></div></div>
      </article>

      <article class="sn-a20-pdp__feature">
        <picture class="sn-a20-pdp__feature-media"><img src="{{ 'suntneew-a20-2026-pdp-05-led.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="A20 emergency LED light with three modes" width="1464" height="600" loading="lazy"></picture>
        <div class="sn-a20-pdp__copy"><div><p class="sn-a20-pdp__eyebrow">Emergency light</p><h3>A light for the shoulder of the road.</h3><p>The integrated 20 lm LED gives the kit a practical second role when you need to inspect a battery connection or signal for attention.</p></div><ul class="sn-a20-pdp__list sn-a20-pdp__list--three" aria-label="A20 LED modes"><li>Steady</li><li>Strobe</li><li>SOS</li></ul></div>
      </article>

      <article class="sn-a20-pdp__feature">
        <picture class="sn-a20-pdp__feature-media"><img src="{{ 'suntneew-a20-2026-pdp-06-safety.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="A20 intelligent clamps and six-in-one protection icons" width="1464" height="600" loading="lazy"></picture>
        <div class="sn-a20-pdp__copy"><div><p class="sn-a20-pdp__eyebrow">Intelligent protection</p><h3>6-in-1 clamp safeguards, made visible.</h3><p>Keep the illustrated protection story with the clamp. The gallery separately shows the eight protection icons supplied with the product’s clamp image.</p></div><ul class="sn-a20-pdp__list" aria-label="A20 protection functions"><li>Reverse polarity</li><li>Overcharge</li><li>Over-discharge</li><li>Short circuit</li><li>Over-current</li><li>Over-voltage</li></ul></div>
      </article>

      <article class="sn-a20-pdp__feature">
        <picture class="sn-a20-pdp__feature-media"><img src="{{ 'suntneew-a20-2026-pdp-07-temperature.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="A20 shown in cold weather conditions" width="1464" height="600" loading="lazy"></picture>
        <div class="sn-a20-pdp__copy"><div><p class="sn-a20-pdp__eyebrow">Working temperature</p><h3>Ready across the seasonal swing.</h3><p>Store and operate the kit in its documented temperature range, and allow for vehicle condition, battery condition and weather when planning a start.</p></div><div class="sn-a20-pdp__metrics"><div class="sn-a20-pdp__metric"><strong>-20°C–60°C</strong><span>Working temperature</span></div><div class="sn-a20-pdp__metric"><strong>IP54</strong><span>Dust and splash protection</span></div><div class="sn-a20-pdp__metric"><strong>ABS + PC + TPU</strong><span>Housing materials</span></div><div class="sn-a20-pdp__metric"><strong>12V</strong><span>Vehicle system class</span></div></div></div>
      </article>

      <article class="sn-a20-pdp__feature">
        <picture class="sn-a20-pdp__feature-media"><img src="{{ 'suntneew-a20-2026-pdp-08-vehicles.png' | asset_url }}" alt="A20 jump starter and compatible vehicle categories" width="1959" height="803" loading="lazy"></picture>
        <div class="sn-a20-pdp__copy"><div><p class="sn-a20-pdp__eyebrow">Vehicle fit</p><h3>A compact kit for compatible 12V vehicles.</h3><p>For compatible 12V gas engines up to 6.5L and diesel engines up to 5.0L. Check the vehicle and product instructions before every use.</p></div><ul class="sn-a20-pdp__list" aria-label="Compatible A20 vehicle categories"><li>Cars & SUVs</li><li>Motorcycles</li><li>ATVs</li><li>Pickups & vans</li><li>Boats</li><li>Lawn equipment</li></ul></div>
      </article>

      <article class="sn-a20-pdp__feature">
        <picture class="sn-a20-pdp__feature-media"><img src="{{ 'suntneew-a20-2026-pdp-09-steps.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Four illustrated A20 jump-start steps" width="1464" height="600" loading="lazy"></picture>
        <div class="sn-a20-pdp__copy"><div><p class="sn-a20-pdp__eyebrow">Four-step connection</p><h3>Connect, check, start, then disconnect.</h3><p>The original visual sequence remains as a quick orientation. Follow the full A20 manual and the vehicle manufacturer’s instructions for the complete safe procedure.</p></div><div class="sn-a20-pdp__steps-note">Step 1: connect the clamp plug. Step 2: attach positive and negative clamps correctly. Step 3: confirm the clamp indication. Step 4: start the compatible vehicle, then disconnect as directed.</div></div>
      </article>

      <article class="sn-a20-pdp__feature">
        <picture class="sn-a20-pdp__feature-media"><img src="{{ 'suntneew-a20-2026-pdp-10-in-box.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="A20 included components shown in the product box" width="1464" height="600" loading="lazy"></picture>
        <div class="sn-a20-pdp__copy"><div><p class="sn-a20-pdp__eyebrow">In the box</p><h3>The starting essentials in one place.</h3><p>This visual follows the source A+ in-box configuration. For the full wording and manual access, use the existing In the Box and Manuals tabs above.</p></div><ul class="sn-a20-pdp__list" aria-label="A20 included components"><li>A20 jump starter × 1</li><li>Smart clamp × 1</li><li>USB cable × 1</li><li>English manual × 1</li><li>Color box × 1</li></ul></div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

